{"title":"Iron Rapier","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Bandit, Hill Giant Youth, Orc Warrior</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 5 · STR 20 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Sword</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Warriors</b> start with it. Everyone else can study a <b>Sword tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-youth\" title=\"Hill Giant Youth - dropped it in 1 of 22 looted corpses (1/22)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/969fc0f03105396b9256.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Youth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/22<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"orc-warrior\" title=\"Orc Warrior - dropped it in 1 of 22 looted corpses (1/22)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/32180983f5b9c9e8250b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Orc Warrior</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/22<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bandit\" title=\"Bandit - dropped it in 2 of 131 looted corpses (1/66)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/66<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"iron-rapier\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier?q=good\">Good <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier?q=superior\">Superior <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/iron-rapier?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"iron-rapier\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\